ecome even deadlier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the <strong>Boss of Hell</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/8953322d63ebb367b60b67865373abd8.poster.avif?t=1774348589\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/8953322d63ebb367b60b67865373abd8.webm?t=1774348589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/8953322d63ebb367b60b67865373abd8.mp4?t=1774348589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO YOU HAVE THE STOMACH FOR THIS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive endless swarms of demonic eyes, push your skills to the limit, crush your own records, and conquer the top of the <strong>Global Leaderboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/acd183e7decc46f4679bb08bfc221ec2.poster.avif?t=1774348589\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/acd183e7decc46f4679bb08bfc221ec2.webm?t=1774348589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510060/extras/acd183e7decc46f4679bb08bfc221ec2.mp4?t=1774348589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T FORGET!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats</strong> don't like getting wet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to carve your path through the underworld and reclaim your soul?</p>",
